#: integrated_channels/integrated_channel/management/commands/cleanup_duplicate_assignment_records.py:25
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Verify and remove any duplicated assignments transmitted to the IntegratedChannel(s) configured for the given\n"
"     EnterpriseCustomer.\n"
"    "
